   "x": 1117.7,
   "y": 254,
   "width": 390.0,
   "height": 93.75,
   "text": "This was the whole surface: enter, w and s\ndispatched three of the twelve commands that can run\nhere, and nothing on the screen named the other\nnine. The frame below is the same queue, now reached\nfrom a screen that lists them all.",
